<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Mission Statement</title>

  <link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css">
</head>

<body>
  <header>
    <h1>My Mission Statement</h1>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section>
      <h2 class="subtitle">Who I Want to Become</h2>
      <p>
        My mission is to live with integrity, grow spiritually, and serve others
        through Christlike love, consistent effort, and lifelong learning.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="subtitle">How I Will Live</h2>
      <p>
        I will strive to develop discipline, seek meaningful relationships, and
        use my talents to bless others while continually improving myself.
      </p>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <p>&copy; 2026 Tanner Tinsley</p>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
